cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this material, please cite the working paper below."
title: "Claude plays Pokémon Emerald (and Emerald Kaizo)"
abstract: >-
  A logged case study of a Claude agent playing Pokémon Emerald and the
  fan-made hard mode Emerald Kaizo through a text harness for days at a time,
  measuring how much human help it needed, what it cost, and whether its own
  account of its play can be checked against the record.
